  "instructions": [
    "Combine rice flour and water in a bowl to form a dough, knead for 5 minutes, then rest for 30 minutes.",
    "Divide dough into 4 equal pieces, roll out each piece into a thin circle, about 1/16 inch thick.",
    "Heat a tava-griddle over medium-high heat, brush with oil, cook shallots until crispy, then set aside.",
    "In a separate pan, combine Pho broth, pork or chicken bones, ginger, and onion, bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add soy sauce to broth, stir to combine.",
    "Ladle hot broth into a bowl, lay a flaky pastry circle on top, sprinkle with crispy shallots, and garnish with scallions.",
    "Repeat with remaining dough and broth.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with additional crispy shallots and scallions if desired."
  ],
